msgid ""
"Archived Topic: Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems (Erle-Brain "
"2)"
msgstr "存档主题：与 Erle-Brain 2 兼容的遥控发射机和接收机系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:7
#: 4a7a5f3c4312442d9241e7a4ea4a807e
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of the RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems"
" that can be used with Erle-Brain 2, along with guidance on how they are "
"connected."
msgstr "本文概述了可与 Erle-Brain 2 配合使用的遥控发射机和接收机系统，以及如何连接的指导。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:12
#: d159e1290f4f44ba968fdb336b09bef0
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:14
#: c0020349afd84e04a5cf2e5212c9493e
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain 2 is compatible with PPM-Sum RC receivers. For traditional "
"single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a `PPM encoder "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/catalog/62753.jpg>`__ can be used "
"to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM."
msgstr ""
"Erle-Brain 2 与 PPM-Sum 遥控接收机兼容。对于传统的单线每通道（PWM）接收机，可以使用 `PPM 编码器 "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/catalog/62753.jpg>`__ 将接收机输出转换为 "
"PPM-SUM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:19
#: bc260b090bc1465cbb60573cc2262316
msgid "Officially supported RCs"
msgstr "官方支持的遥控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:22
#: b2c7ee5d8db84bb9ae92f67142151bcc
msgid "Turnigy TGY-i6"
msgstr "Turnigy TGY-i6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:27
#: 92d29b6cce5d4962abfba78639c19a98
msgid ""
"This RC receiver comes with 6 pin output, one per each PPM channel. As Erle-"
"Brain only accepts PPM-Sum input type, conversion from 8 PPM channel to one "
"PPM-Sum is needed."
msgstr ""
"此遥控接收机具有 6 针输出，每个 PPM 通道一针。由于 Erle-Brain 只接受 PPM-Sum 输入类型，需要将 8 个 PPM "
"通道转换为一个 PPM-Sum。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:31
#: c355b089950841eba1bf9174d5dc477d
msgid ""
"This conversion is made using a PPM Encoder. This module sums up the 8 PPM "
"channels into a PPM-Sum type, which is supported by Erle-Brain."
msgstr "此转换使用 PPM 编码器完成。该模块将 8 个 PPM 通道合并为 Erle-Brain 支持的 PPM-Sum 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:34
#: ee14d42fe2294989b664fd21fc0a82f0
msgid ""
"For more information see the `manual "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/uploads/1022671243X1465900X53.pdf>`__"
" and the `official documentation "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Robots/Common_Parts/Radio_Control.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关更多信息，请参阅 `手册 "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/uploads/1022671243X1465900X53.pdf>`__"
" 和 `官方文档 "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Robots/Common_Parts/Radio_Control.html>`__。"

