#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:52
#: 9d8580445c934e27a9d2be525bc43e9b
msgid "FlySky TH9x"
msgstr "FlySky TH9x"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:57
#: 10a6c7f2e649475da78337e5a77c53b3
msgid ""
"This RC has 9 channels and is highly recommended if you need to control one "
"or more optional components (for example a gimbal or EPM)."
msgstr "此遥控有 9 个通道，如果您需要控制一个或多个可选组件（例如云台或 EPM），强烈推荐使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:60
#: 98885bfc25ac4630a63b15684853f948
msgid ""
"For more information, check out the `manual "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/uploads/358697369X13667X46.pdf>`__."
" In order to connect this module, you only need to follow `this "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Erle-"
"Brain_2/Hardware/RC_Input.html>`__ official documentation section."
msgstr ""
"有关更多信息，请查看 `手册 "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/uploads/358697369X13667X46.pdf>`__。要连接此模块，您只需按照"
" `此 <http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Erle-"
"Brain_2/Hardware/RC_Input.html>`__ 官方文档部分操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:68
#: 5adbde547d4d4ddd9d8b5cb2578cae04
msgid "You'll also need a PPM encoder to use this RC under Erle-Brain2"
msgstr "在 Erle-Brain2 下使用此遥控，您还需要 PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:72
#: a5b779dfec9b48f988b41b4905afa30f
msgid "Other RCs"
msgstr "其他遥控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:74
#: 7533da5d59a045538e7acbdafac4c8f4
msgid ""
"In addition to the officially supported RCs, you can connect any PPM-SUM "
"type RC receiver."
msgstr "除官方支持的遥控外，您还可以连接任何 PPM-SUM 类型的遥控接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:78
#: b2ed2475b9d3471080660817f38b3b31
msgid "Turnigy Transmitter Compatible With FRSky Transmitter Module"
msgstr "与 FRSky 发射机模块兼容的 Turnigy 发射机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:84
#: 387e9e90b39946faada042bf1c202f61
msgid "FRSky Transmitter Adapter Module and PPM-Sum Receiver"
msgstr "FRSky 发射机适配器模块和 PPM-Sum 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:86
#: ce4ce649cbed4f9e87eb72f9198bf7bd
msgid ""
"The FR-Sky PPM Sum Receiver and conversion module below will work with "
"Turnigy 9x, 9XR (above) and other RC transmitters."
msgstr "以下 FR-Sky PPM Sum 接收机和转换模块可与 Turnigy 9x、9XR（上述）及其他遥控发射机配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:89
#: 27904d4cc07a4988a9fe2f1c8121b88a
msgid ""
"FRSky makes several receivers, only some of which are compatible with PPM-"
"Sum. You can check for compatibility at `FRSky's web site <http://www.frsky-"
"rc.com/product/product.php?cate_id=12&cate_name=Receivers>`__."
msgstr ""
"FRSky 生产多种接收机，其中只有部分与 PPM-Sum 兼容。您可以在 `FRSky 官网 <http://www.frsky-"
"rc.com/product/product.php?cate_id=12&cate_name=Receivers>`__ 查看兼容性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2.rst:92
#: 711ba0f06e20485786a904d50ba61f8c
msgid ""
"The receiver shown is PPM-Sum compatible and is recommended (4 channel "
"receivers still do 8 channel PPM-Sum)."
msgstr "所示接收机与 PPM-Sum 兼容，推荐使用（4 通道接收机仍支持 8 通道 PPM-Sum）。"

